<title>USA: Richfood sets stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Richfood sets stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Richfood Holdings Inc said Monday directors had authorized the repurchase, from time to time over the next 12 months, of up to one million common shares.</p>
<p>It said repurchases, if any, may be made through open market purchases or in privately negotiated transactions. Any shares repurchased will be canceled, it said.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
